==English==

===Etymology===
{{m|en|frame|pos=noun}} + {{m|en|of}} + {{m|en|reference|pos=noun}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|frames of reference}}

# A [[set]] of [[assumption]]s, [[idea]]s and [[standard]]s that form a [[viewpoint]] from which [[philosophical]], [[religious]] and other ideas may be [[evaluated]].
#: {{ux|en|Anyone with an unsubverted or deprogrammed '''frame of reference''' likely couldn't bear seeing such mistreatment and violence.}}
# {{lb|en|physics}} A set of [[axes]] which enable an [[observer]] to [[measure]] the [[position]] and [[motion]] of all [[bodies]] in some [[system]] [[relative]] to the reference frame.

